  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">皆さんこんにちは！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">鳥取県出身</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s3\">高校</span><span class=\"s2\">3</span><span class=\"s3\">年生</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;17</span><span class=\"s3\">歳</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">山口陽世（やまぐちはるよ）です！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2021-08-03/40339_0.jpg\">ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">8</span><span class=\"s3\">月になりましたね〜！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">暑いけど体調に気をつけてくださいね！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">水分補給大事です</span><span class=\"s4\">☝️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">なんか、夏っぽい写真ないかな〜と探していたらありました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_0080.jpeg\" id=\"2B2A5DA0-B647-4F69-AA51-400CC4C812C6\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2021-08-03/40339_1.jpg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">ひな図書さんで着させていただきました</span><span class=\"s4\">☺️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">加入するまで浴衣などを祭りで着たことがなかったので、ゲーム撮影などで着ることができてとても嬉しいです</span><span class=\"s4\">😆</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">皆さん最近は何をしていますか〜</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">私はオリンピックを観ています</span><span class=\"s4\">👀</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">どの種目も観ていて楽しくて、家にいる時はずっと流しています！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">昨日は野球を観ていました〜</span><span class=\"s4\">⚾️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">最後まで目が離せない試合でドキドキしながら観ていました</span><span class=\"s4\">👀</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\">あまり詳しくないのですが、すごく興味をひかれました！</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\">楽しく応援させて頂いていますꉂꉂ📢</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">野球のユニフォームを着た時の写真があったので載せますね</span><span class=\"s2\">( ¨̮ )</span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_2819.jpeg\" id=\"12D781FB-33EB-4499-B497-A8D388772692\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2021-08-03/40339_2.jpg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">試合を観ていたら久しぶりにボール投げたくなりました</span><span class=\"s4\">😊</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">今日、ボクシング女子フェザー級で入江聖奈選手が金メダルを獲得しましたね</span><span class=\"s4\">🥇</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">おめでとうございます</span><span class=\"s4\">🎊</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">同じ鳥取県出身の方が金メダルをとっておられてすごく嬉しいし、私も頑張ろうと勇気をもらいました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">スポーツをしている姿本当にかっこよくて素敵です</span><span class=\"s4\">✨</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">これからもオリンピック観させていただきますꉂꉂ📣</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">1</span><span class=\"s3\">人だけの写真のまま終わりたくないので、まりぃちゃんとの写真で終わります</span><span class=\"s4\">🐶</span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_0181.jpeg\" id=\"8E482764-6A9E-4D0F-8DC7-DAFB68FB27C5\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2021-08-03/40339_3.jpg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span>パーってしてます🖐🏻</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 