  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>皆<rt>みな</rt></ruby>さんこんにちは！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>鳥取<rt>とっとり</rt></ruby><ruby>県<rt>けん</rt></ruby><ruby>出身<rt>しゅっしん</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>高校<rt>こうこう</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s2\">3</span><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>年<rt>とし</rt></ruby><ruby>生<rt>せい</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;17</span><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>歳<rt>とし</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\"><ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby><ruby>陽<rt>よう</rt></ruby><ruby>世<rt>よ</rt></ruby>（やまぐちはるよ）です！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2021-08-03/40339_0.jpg\">ブログを<ruby>開<rt>ひら</rt></ruby>いて<ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さりありがとうございます！</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: n